<title>USA: St Louis feeder cattle market steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Louis feeder cattle market steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>EAST ST LOUIS, Ill. 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>FEEDER CATTLE AUCTION: 250 head. Compared to last week, light supply feeder steers and heifers steady. Overall quality below last week's level. Moderate buyer attendance.</p>
<p>FEEDER STEERS: Medium and Large Frame 1:</p>
<p>600-700 lbs. 65.00-71.00, Package crossbreds at 74.00</p>
<p>700-800 lbs. 63.00-68.00</p>
<p>Moderately Fleshy:</p>
<p>700-900 lbs. 56.00-63.00</p>
<p>Large Frame 2 Holsteins: 500-1000 lbs. 46.00-53.00.</p>
<p>FEEDER HEIFERS: Medium and Large Frame 1:</p>
<p>600-700 lbs. 60.00-64.00</p>
<p>Moderately Fleshy:</p>
<p>500-700 lbs. 55.00-62.00</p>
<p>Receipts 250  Last week  650  Last Year  400</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
